{"id":"5932","groups":[{"type":"pnri","label":"相关图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/5932_main_cumulus-fractus-of-wet-weather_clouds.png","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc1\"><p>照片中是<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">边缘破碎的小积云</span>。轮廓通常快速变化，而且是碎积云实例。鉴于此类云的形成是由于高空的云降水使空气变湿，因此，认定为潮湿天气的碎积云。图中还有一些破碎的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">碎层云</span>，它们共同构成碎片附属云。在峡湾内可看到降水；这是<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">降水性附加特征</span>。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Michael Bruhn","location":"澳大利亚，塔斯马尼亚，鹰颈峡","latitude":"纬度: 43° 0' 24'' S","longitude":"经度: 147° 55' 56'' E","date":"13 August 2011 1320 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向北东南","cloudCode":"CL= 2, CM= /, CH= /","code":"图像P/S代码: P.9.22","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.9.22"},{"src":"/images/original/syn/5932_syn_cumulus-fractus-of-wet-weather_clouds.gif","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc2\"><p>低压槽正向东北方向移动穿过该地区，紧随其后的是高压脊。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 澳大利亚联邦2011，澳大利亚气象局","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/original/upper/5932_upper_cumulus-fractus-of-wet-weather_clouds.gif","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc3\"><p>澳大利亚塔斯马尼亚州霍巴特（WMO 94975）的探测显示出上至约850 hPa的不稳定性。在中层可看到浅湿层。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 怀俄明大学","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/compressed/sat/5932_sat_cumulus-fractus-of-wet-weather_clouds.jpeg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc4\"><p>在这张红外图像中，低压槽从塔斯曼海的冷锋延伸至澳大利亚塔斯马尼亚州鹰颈峡北部（照片位置以红箭头标示）。低云覆盖塔斯马尼亚州大部分地区。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© EUMETSAT, 2011","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""}]},{"type":"seci","label":"其他图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/5946_main_cumulus-fractus-and-stratus-fractus-altostratogenitus_clouds.png","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc5\"><p>在密布的一层含雨蔽光高层云下形成了潮湿天气碎积云。更阴暗的阴影云块是<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">碎积云</span>；这些云块的垂直厚度通常大于<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">碎层云</span>，且通常有略微圆形的顶。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Michael Bruhn","location":"澳大利亚，布罗德梅多斯VIC 3047","latitude":"纬度: 37° 41' 24'' S","longitude":"经度: 144° 56' 50'' E","date":"27 November 2012 0846 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向东","cloudCode":"CL= 7, CM= 2, CH= /","code":"图像P/S代码: S.9.22","imageId":"图像P/S代码: S.9.22"}]}]}